  "//": "HALO top v2 (branch halo-pdn): hub-and-spoke matching xbar pin sides (W=ibex, E=uart, N=imem/esram, S=dmem) on a 3200x3200 die, 45% fill, 250-350um dataflow channels. v1 (2700x2800, corner layout, 100-260um channels) hit GRT-0116 with 6760 M2/M3 overflow: blocks obstruct M1-M3 so inter-block routing is channel-confined, and the wide TL buses jammed the narrow channels + xbar-in-corner long routes. Default top M4/M5 grid in channels; macro-halo grid + PDN_MACRO_CONNECTIONS tie block rings. Run: harden_block.sh top_pd --skip KLayout.Render --skip OpenROAD.IRDropReport.",
